Package: jdwp-knife
Architecture: all
Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, python3
Description: JDWP exploitation tool with interactive shell
 jdwp-knife is a specialized tool for extracting data from running JVMs 
 via Java Debug Wire Protocol (JDWP). It supports RCE, interactive 
 shell, and environment data extraction without outbound network connection.
